{"id":"n70889-1-7","stage":1,"title":"정원 · 庭院","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70889-1-7-1","ko":"이번에 이사 간 집은 어때?","zh":"这次搬的新家怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"이사","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}},{"text":"간","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3"}},{"text":"집은","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집은","audio":"/audio/4f9292df3492ba091440.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"925efb171a8616cc","term":"이사","zh":"搬家","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3","entryId":"71138","definition":"离开原先生活的地方，搬去别的地方。","pronunciation":["이사"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/37686b809b826932cb68.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70889-1-7-2","ko":"정원이 넓어서 채소나 과일을 심을 수도 있을 것 같아.","zh":"花园很大，应该可以种蔬菜或水果吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정원이","meaning":"庭院，院子","explanation":"정원：庭院，院子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정원","audio":"/audio/d5c971809d22cbbd4066.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70889","senseId":"1","lemma":"정원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정원이","audio":"/audio/303da0dea93af45e094e.mp3"}},{"text":"넓어서","meaning":"宽敞，宽阔，宽广","explanation":"넓다：宽敞，宽阔，宽广；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넓다","audio":"/audio/a1c6fc943afd6c1195c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64511","senseId":"1","lemma":"넓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넓어서","audio":"/audio/f70aff965fea7000b2fe.mp3"}},{"text":"채소나","meaning":"菜，蔬菜","explanation":"채소：菜，蔬菜；나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"채소","audio":"/audio/2193870aa946b1dfff09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72036","senseId":"1","lemma":"채소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"채소나","audio":"/audio/df02534e00f563a792ef.mp3"}},{"text":"과일을","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과일을","audio":"/audio/57f9e12ecc4539af2a99.mp3"}},{"text":"심을","meaning":"种植，种，栽","explanation":"심다：种植，种，栽；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"심다","audio":"/audio/9945af5ffe48ce1fd446.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64968","senseId":"1","lemma":"심다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심을","audio":"/audio/4481dacb9d596e40973e.mp3"}},{"text":"수도","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수도","audio":"/audio/b42d1b5bced00efc95ca.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d5c971809d22cbbd","term":"정원","zh":"庭院，院子","audio":"/audio/d5c971809d22cbbd4066.mp3","entryId":"70889","definition":"在家种植草或树木的草地或花园。","pronunciation":["정원"]},{"id":"a1c6fc943afd6c11","term":"넓다","zh":"宽敞，宽阔，宽广","audio":"/audio/a1c6fc943afd6c1195c8.mp3","entryId":"64511","definition":"整个面或地面的面积很大。","pronunciation":["널따"]},{"id":"2193870aa946b1df","term":"채소","zh":"菜，蔬菜","audio":"/audio/2193870aa946b1dfff09.mp3","entryId":"72036","definition":"栽种在田里的、茎叶或果实可食用的农作物。","pronunciation":["채ː소"]},{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"9945af5ffe48ce1f","term":"심다","zh":"种植，种，栽","audio":"/audio/9945af5ffe48ce1fd446.mp3","entryId":"64968","definition":"将草木等的根或种子埋到土里。","pronunciation":["심ː따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a728ac5820f025aab09.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.68,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70889","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":53,"sequenceScore":2.3334,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["花园很大，应该可以种蔬菜或水果吧。","这次搬的新家怎么样？","这个相框要挂在这里吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次搬的新家怎么样？","这个相框要挂在这里吗？","花园很大，应该可以种蔬菜或水果吧。"],"answer":2}]}
